{"type":"message","id":"34f8a1c9","parentId":"81868771","timestamp":"2026-04-30T18:56:20.546Z","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"Conversation info (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"chat_id\": \"telegram:831236913\",\n  \"message_id\": \"228\",\n  \"sender_id\": \"831236913\",\n  \"sender\": \"Johann Canon\",\n  \"timestamp\": \"Fri 2026-05-01 02:56 GMT+8\"\n}\n```\n\nSender (untrusted metadata):\n```json\n{\n  \"label\": \"Johann Canon (831236913)\",\n  \"id\": \"831236913\",\n  \"name\": \"Johann Canon\",\n  \"username\": \"johanncanon\"\n}\n```\n\nhola MiguelAngel que bueno verte! aqui tengo un cliente, se llama Senerc (https://senerc.com.co/)\nestos sus competidores:\n- https://simac.com.co/\n- https://smart-ing.com/\n- https://gers.com.co/\ninicia el proyecto de investigacion con la fase 1porfavor"}],"timestamp":1777575380544}}
