partners are technology providers, knowledge entities, and public and private sector organizations that support innovation and technological development.\\n\\nSIMAC connects customer needs with the science and technology ecosystem.\\n\\nSee more\\n\\n// SERVICES\\n\\nStrategic Business Units\\nAutomation, motion control and telecommunications\\n\\nIndustrial automation and control , sale of supplies and equipment. Consulting in industrial automation, instrumentation selection and sizing of programmable logic controllers.\\n\\nSIMAC SAS is one of the companies that is part of the SIEMENS SOLUTION PARTNER program , which categorizes it as a systems integrator with extensive knowledge in technology and processes in the SIEMENS AUTOMATION equipment range .\\n\\nSee more\\nElectrical substations and engineering projects\\n\\nWe are integrators of Rittal brand low-voltage electrical substations , with current capacity up to 5500A, short-circuit capacity of 100kA, IP66 protection rating and IK09 protection rating. Certified under Retie 2013 regulations.\\n\\nOur products: Engineering, development, integration, assembly and commissioning of Motor Control Centers (MCCs), Variable speed drives, soft starters up to 5500A, 100kA short circuit.\\n\\nSee more\\nDigital transformation\\n\\nInformation integration is a strategy for locating value-added information, which challenges the way companies have been managing their manufacturing processes and organizational culture.\\n\\nSee more\\nWhat our customers say\\n{\\nReliable and innovative\\n“A reliable collaborator who proposes innovative alternatives for process control and automation systems, always willing with a collaborative attitude and great human warmth”\\n5 \\nTICSA Colombia\\n{\\nStrategic ally\\n\\\"Compañía de Empaques is a company that works with the transformation of natural fibers and plastic resins. Together with SIMAC, we have worked on the reliability and efficiency of production equipment, emphasizing research and development, technological reconversion, and automation in control and speed variation systems. In addition, SIMAC is a registered supplier of COMPAÑÍA DE EMPAQUES as an ally, providing us with equipment for use in production plants of different brands.\\\"\\n5 \\nPackaging Company\\n\\n// SGS ORGANIZATION\\n\\nCertifications\\n\\nWe are certified by the SGS organization; under the integrated management systems standards.\\n\\nAND\\n\\t\\nDesign, supply, construction, assembly, maintenance, testing and commissioning of Automation, Supervision, Control and Telecommunications Systems.\\nAND\\n\\t\\nDesign, Consulting, Supply and commissioning of Energy Management Systems.\\nAND\\n\\t\\nMarketing of Automation, Telecommunications and Energy Equipment.\\n\\n// CURRENT EVENTS\\n\\nLatest News\\nKey Cybersecurity Strategies: Protect your business and ensure its continuity in the digital world\\n\\nOct 28, 2024 | Industrial Cybersecurity\\n\\nCybersecurity has become a crucial issue for businesses across all sectors. With the rise in cyberattacks, it is essential...\\n\\nread more\\nThe evolution towards Industry 5.0 technology\\n\\nApril 29, 2024 | Artificial Intelligence , Digital Transformation\\n\\nIn the constant pursuit of efficiency and optimization, industry has undergone an unprecedented evolution, from mechanization to...\\n\\nread more\\nProtecting productivity: Understand the importance of industrial cybersecurity\\n\\nApr 2, 2024 | Industrial Cybersecurity\\n\\nIn the digital age in which we live, industrial cybersecurity has become a fundamental pillar for the protection of...\\n\\nread more\\n« Older entries\\nWe are official distributors of the following brands\\n\\nDo you want a consultation?\\n\\nFields marked with * are required\\nBy submitting your data you accept the terms and conditions in accordance with the company's personal data processing policy *\\n\\nContact us\\n\\nMedellín Headquarters\\n\\n\\n\\t\\nCalle 35D No. 90-22\\n\\n\\t\\n+57 604 5830088\\n\\n\\t\\n+57 310 498 4117\\n\\n\\t\\ncomercial@simac.com.co\\n\\nServices\\n\\nAutomation and Control,\\nEnergy Management,\\nElectrical Substations,\\nDigital Transformation\\n\\nDeveloped by CSL Digital Global. SIMAC SAS. All rights reserved 2024.\"},\"error\":null}","cwd":"/root/.openclaw/workspace"},"isError":false,"timestamp":1777575421873}}
